#: tpl/general/online.tpl.php:86
msgid ""
"<strong>Critical CSS (CCSS)</strong> loads visible above-the-fold content "
"faster and with full styling."
msgstr "<strong>關鍵 CSS (CCSS)</strong> 能更快載入瀏覽器首屏可見的內容，並完整呈現樣式。"

#: tpl/general/online.tpl.php:71
msgid ""
"<strong>Image Optimization</strong> gives you smaller image file sizes that "
"transmit faster."
msgstr "<strong>圖片優化</strong> 可讓您的圖片檔案大小更小，傳輸速度更快。"

#: tpl/general/online.tpl.php:88
msgid ""
"<strong>Low Quality Image Placeholder (LQIP)</strong> gives your imagery a "
"more pleasing look as it lazy loads."
msgstr "<strong>低畫質圖片占位符 (LQIP)</strong> 能在延遲載入時，讓您的圖片呈現更美觀的外觀。"

#: tpl/general/online.tpl.php:72
msgid ""
"<strong>Page Optimization</strong> streamlines page styles and visual "
"elements for faster loading."
msgstr "<strong>頁面優化</strong> 透過精簡頁面樣式與視覺元素，提升載入速度。"

#: tpl/general/online.tpl.php:87
msgid ""
"<strong>Unique CSS (UCSS)</strong> removes unused style definitions for a "
"speedier page load overall."
msgstr "<strong>Unique CSS (UCSS)</strong> 會移除未使用的樣式定義，以提升整體網頁載入速度。"

#: tpl/general/online.tpl.php:89
msgid ""
"<strong>Viewport Images (VPI)</strong> provides a well-polished fully-loaded "
"view above the fold."
msgstr "<strong>Viewport Images (VPI)</strong> 提供一個經過精心打磨、功能齊全的「折疊上方」視圖。"

#: tpl/img_optm/summary.tpl.php:188
msgid "A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized."
msgstr "在進行優化之前，會先為每張圖片建立備份。"

#: tpl/cache/settings-purge.tpl.php:152
msgid "A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks."
msgstr "當 WordPress 執行這些鉤子時，將會執行「清除所有資料」操作。"

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:25
msgid ""
"A QUIC.cloud connection is not required to use this preset. Only basic "
"caching features are enabled."
msgstr "使用此預設值無需建立 QUIC.cloud 連線。僅啟用基本快取功能。"

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:85
msgid ""
"A QUIC.cloud connection is required to use this preset. Enables the maximum "
"level of optimizations for improved page speed scores."
msgstr "使用此預設值需具備 QUIC.cloud 連線。此設定可啟用最高等級的優化功能，以提升網頁速度評分。"

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:56 tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:70
msgid ""
"A QUIC.cloud connection is required to use this preset. Includes many "
"optimizations known to improve page speed scores."
msgstr "使用此預設值需具備 QUIC.cloud 連線。其中包含多項已知可提升網頁速度評分的優化措施。"

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:37
